  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "霜葉？霜葉？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭！這裡是第二偵查小隊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們正在撤退！但是對方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又斷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三偵查小隊！聽得見嗎！第三偵查小隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生！是我！你接到了嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在艦橋監控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你幫我問問你身邊那個陳警官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就問——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“龍門還要裝腔作勢到什麼時候？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才的發言，我就當沒聽到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，這確實不是什麼還能悠悠哉哉的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出了什麼事？我不過拿個報表，你們兩個的表情就變得那麼嚴肅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——有任務？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家......整理下裝備，我覺得，應該是時候出發了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳長官，我請求龍門出動近衛局，配合羅德島進行救援任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至，那裡會有整合運動的臨時指揮部——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，各個偵查小隊，一定還在我看不見的地方戰鬥著......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
